4. LOG INTERNAL STRUCTURE (MANDATORY)

Every log must contain:

LOG HEADER
- Immutable Instructions
- Global Summary
- Patch Index Map
- Tag Manifest


---

4.1 Immutable Instructions (Top Block)

- Append-only patches only
- No retroactive modification of completed patches
- State transitions must follow lifecycle rules
- IndexSummary is a mirror, not a copy system


---

4.2 Global Summary

Purpose of log

Current system state

High-level impact



---

4.3 Patch Index Map (Line Addressing System)

Every log MUST declare patch ranges:

Patch 1 → lines 25–40
Patch 2 → lines 41–78
Patch 3 → lines 79–102

This enables deterministic navigation.


---

5. PATCH STRUCTURE STANDARD

Each patch must include:

5.1 Patch Content

Implementation changes

Design notes

Decisions

Outcomes



---

5.2 Patch Summary Block

Patch X Summary:
- What changed
- Why it exists
- Dependencies
- Result state


---

5.3 Tag Manifest (~20 tags required)

Each patch includes structured tags:

#implementation #active #routing #memory #governance
#indexing #traceability #jarvis-core #log-system
#refactor #optimization #deterministic #state-machine
#low-risk #medium-risk #high-impact
#mnemos #odin #hades #indexsummary

Tag dimensions:

Lifecycle

System mapping

Intent

Risk

Function

Dependency



---

6. STATE TRANSITION RULES

6.1 Active → Implemented

- Move only finalized patch content
- Remove transferred content from Active
- Preserve Active log continuity

6.2 Implemented → Inactive

- Move deprecated or superseded implementations
- Remove from Implemented after transfer


---

Critical Rule: No Log Bloat Transfer

Never move full logs.

Only move:

completed patch sections

validated implementation blocks



---

7. INDEXSUMMARY SYSTEM (MIRROR MODEL)

IndexSummary does NOT duplicate content.

It mirrors structure.

ISLog Entry:

Object: Hierarchy-Patch-1
Location: Implementation/Implemented/IPLog-0003

Patch Map:
- Patch 1 → 25–40
- Patch 2 → 41–78

Tags:
#memory #routing #governance

State: Implemented


---

7.1 IndexSummary Rule

No full content replication

Only metadata + routing pointers

Must reflect latest state of source log



---

7.2 Sync Rule (Critical)

Any change in Active / Implemented / Inactive MUST update IndexSummary.


---

